            "value" : "Apple Watch"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Watch derives workout zones from your heart-rate reserve, so its numbers differ from age-based ones. Import to estimate them from Health, or type the exact values from the Fitness app for a perfect match." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Apple Watch leitet Trainingszonen aus deiner Herzfrequenzreserve ab, daher weichen sie von altersbasierten Werten ab. Importiere sie aus Health oder tippe die exakten Werte aus der Fitness-App ein."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El Apple Watch calcula las zonas de entrenamiento a partir de tu reserva de frecuencia cardíaca, por lo que sus valores difieren de los basados en la edad. Impórtalas desde Salud para estimarlas o introduce los valores exactos de la app Fitness para una coincidencia perfecta."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "L’Apple Watch calcule les zones d’effort à partir de la réserve cardiaque : elles diffèrent des zones selon l’âge. Importez-les depuis Santé ou saisissez les valeurs exactes de l’app Forme."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple Watch は心拍予備能からワークアウトのゾーンを算出するため、年齢ベースの値とは異なります。ヘルスケアから読み込んで概算するか、フィットネス App に表示される正確な値を入力すると完全に一致します。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple Watch는 심박수 예비량으로 운동 존을 계산하므로 나이 기반 수치와 다릅니다. 건강 앱에서 가져와 추정하거나, 피트니스 앱의 정확한 값을 직접 입력하세요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O Apple Watch deriva as zonas de treino da sua reserva de frequência cardíaca, então diferem das baseadas em idade. Importe do app Saúde ou digite os valores exatos do app Fitness."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple Watch 以心率儲備推算運動區間，數值會和以年齡推算的不同。可從「健康」匯入做估算，或照「健身」App 顯示的數值手動輸入以完全對齊。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
