    "Build your aerobic base and lift your fitness with workouts tuned to you — Zone 2 easy days and Norwegian 4×4 intervals." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Baue deine aerobe Basis auf und steigere deine Fitness mit Workouts nach Maß — lockere Zone-2-Tage und norwegische 4×4-Intervalle."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Desarrolla tu base aeróbica y mejora tu forma física con entrenamientos a tu medida: días suaves de Zona 2 e intervalos noruegos 4×4."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Construisez votre base aérobie et progressez avec des séances sur mesure : jours faciles en Zone 2 et intervalles 4×4 norvégiens."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "あなたに合わせたワークアウトで有酸素ベースを築き、体力を高めましょう——Zone 2 のイージーデイとノルウェー式 4×4 インターバル。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "맞춤 운동으로 유산소 기초를 다지고 체력을 끌어올리세요 — 편안한 Zone 2와 노르웨이식 4×4 인터벌."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Construa sua base aeróbica e melhore o condicionamento com treinos sob medida — dias leves em Zona 2 e intervalos 4×4 noruegueses."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用為你量身打造的訓練建立有氧基礎、提升體能——Zone 2 輕鬆日與挪威式 4×4 間歇。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Builds aerobic base without piling on fatigue." : {
