    "This week is %@× your 4-week norm (%lld vs ~%lld min). Consider easing — big jumps drive overtraining and injury." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Diese Woche liegt beim %@-Fachen deiner 4-Wochen-Norm (%lld vs. ~%lld Min). Nimm etwas raus — große Sprünge fördern Übertraining und Verletzungen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esta semana es %1$@× tu media de 4 semanas (%2$lld frente a ~%3$lld min). Considera aflojar: los saltos bruscos provocan sobreentrenamiento y lesiones."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cette semaine fait %@× votre norme sur 4 semaines (%lld vs ~%lld min). Levez le pied : les gros écarts mènent au surentraînement et aux blessures."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今週は直近4週平均の%1$@倍です（%2$lld分 vs 約%3$lld分）。急な増量はオーバートレーニングやけがのもと。ペースを落としましょう。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "이번 주는 4주 평균의 %@배입니다(%lld분 vs 약 %lld분). 급격한 증가는 과훈련과 부상의 원인이 되니 완화를 고려하세요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esta semana está %@× sua média de 4 semanas (%lld vs ~%lld min). Considere aliviar — saltos grandes causam overtraining e lesões."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本週訓練量是近 4 週平均的 %1$@ 倍（%2$lld 分鐘 vs 約 %3$lld 分鐘）。建議放緩——突然加量容易導致過度訓練與受傷。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
